  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Leadership, Empowerment and Advocacy-Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus of WE Leap is to economically empower women through support and strengthening of Internal Savings and Lending Schemes (ISALs), income generating projects, access to markets and value chains to ensure that women and girls live a violent free lives enabling them to fulfil their social, economic and political rights including taking on leadership roles at household, community and national level. Oxfam will support this through capacity strengthening through providing revolving funds, linkages to government stakeholders and advocacy and influencing and offer technical support through monitoring and support visits.</narrative>
  </description>
